# Forum Familiar (1/1, Disguise {1}{W}): "When this creature is turned face up, return another target permanent you control to its owner's hand and put a +1/+1
# counter on this creature." (CR 702.168d, 701.40b, 603.2, 400.3, 122.1). Bot1 casts it face down with a Black Lotus, next to a Memnite; Bot2 has a Memnite. On turn 3 Bot1
# turns it up for exactly {1}{W} (a Mox Pearl and a Mox Jet): the trigger refuses the Familiar itself ("another") and Bot2's Memnite (not Bot1's), and Bot1 chooses its own
# Memnite, which goes back to its hand while the Familiar becomes a 2/2 with a +1/+1 counter.

